00:59:09,110 --> 00:59:10,940
So we have made it, first of all, history.

921
00:59:11,020 --> 00:59:14,940
There is no national identity. And whatever identity is there, it is under Pakistan.

922
00:59:15,020 --> 00:59:21,940
It's not Sindhi, which is five thousand years old. It's not Pakhtun, which is thousands of years old.

923
00:59:22,020 --> 00:59:25,940
It's not Punjabi, definitely. And Baloch Baloch is not seen. Right?

924
00:59:26,020 --> 00:59:28,940
Whatever it is, it will be under the Pakistan flag.

925
00:59:29,020 --> 00:59:33,940
So where there is so much at the national level, what can a common man do?

926
00:59:34,020 --> 00:59:38,750
There are people who keep it alive who teach their children whatever folklores are.

927
00:59:38,830 --> 00:59:52,750
I have those people on my Facebook who are from the arts community and they organize the Punjab fairs.

928
00:59:52,830 --> 00:59:56,750
They are in the Arts Council, and 100-200 people come and dance there.

929
00:59:56,830 --> 01:00:02,608
Now, where on one side there are state-backed entities who are giving you doses,

