They still celebrate culture because they teach their parents, who work hard, that these are your roots.

966
01:02:14,610 --> 01:02:19,530
You came from here, okay, you live in England, or you live in New Zealand, or you live in Australia.

967
01:02:19,610 --> 01:02:20,510
But this is very.

968
01:02:20,590 --> 01:02:22,510
This is where your roots have come from.

